RTL/TB changes made since v1 (see git diff for detail):
  - stream_sink.sv: added optional STALL_EN/STALL_PERIOD/STALL_READY
    back-pressure model (default disabled — identical to original
    always-ready behavior). Needed because with an always-ready sink,
    axis_fifo drains every cycle it holds data (FWFT) and FIFO_DEPTH can
    NEVER affect anything — confirmed as the root cause of the "FIFO_DEPTH
    made zero difference" result in v1.
  - stream_sink.sv: fixed a real correctness bug this exposed — pkt_done
    was qualified only on (s_tvalid && s_tlast), which is only a valid
    AXI-S "beat transferred" check when s_tready is permanently 1. Under
    the new stall model, tvalid/tlast can stay asserted for several cycles
    while waiting for tready, so the old check fired pkt_done once per
    waiting cycle instead of once per actual transfer (pkt_count read 24
    instead of 6 before the fix). Now correctly gated on
    (s_tvalid && s_tready && s_tlast).
  - pcie_axi_dma_top.sv: fixed fifo_occupancy port width, which was sized
    to the package default FIFO_DEPTH (64) instead of the actual FIFO_DEPTH
    parameter — silently truncated for FIFO_DEPTH=256 runs.
  - tb_pcie_axi_dma.sv: added FIFO_PEAK / FULL? columns to [RESULT] rows,
    tracking peak fifo_occupancy and whether fifo_full was ever asserted
    during each packet's transit.
  - Makefile: exposed SINK_STALL_EN/PERIOD/READY as overridable generics.

Runs executed (8 total, all PASS — no timeouts, no $error, watchdog held):
  1. run_scenario0_baseline_fifo64.log      TB_SCENARIO=0                         FIFO_DEPTH=64
  2. run_scenario1_batching_fifo64.log      TB_SCENARIO=1 (batching, non-bypass)  FIFO_DEPTH=64
  3. run_scenario2_fifo16.log               TB_SCENARIO=2                         FIFO_DEPTH=16
  4. run_scenario2_fifo64.log               TB_SCENARIO=2                         FIFO_DEPTH=64
  5. run_scenario2_fifo256.log              TB_SCENARIO=2                         FIFO_DEPTH=256
  6. run_scenario2_stall_fifo16.log         TB_SCENARIO=2 SINK_STALL_EN=1(1/4)    FIFO_DEPTH=16
  7. run_scenario2_stall_fifo64.log         TB_SCENARIO=2 SINK_STALL_EN=1(1/4)    FIFO_DEPTH=64
  8. run_scenario2_stall_fifo256.log        TB_SCENARIO=2 SINK_STALL_EN=1(1/4)    FIFO_DEPTH=256

